 "raw_text": "9/30/26, 5:12 AM\n\nMaster Data\n\nPurpose\n\nThis component contains data for the Utilities Industry (IS-U) component that remains unchanged over a long period of time.\n\nThere are two different types of master data:\n\nBusiness Master Data\n\nBusiness Partner\n\nService Provider\n\nContract Account\n\nNon-Billable Service\n\nContract\n(Billable Service)\n\nBusiness master data includes:\n\ne Business partner\n\ne Contract account\n\ne Contract (billable service)\ne Service provider\n\ne Non-billable service\n\nTechnical master data includes:\n\ne Grid\n\ne Point of delivery\n\ne Connection\n\ne Connection object\ne Technical installation\ne Premise\n\ne Device location\n\ne Installation\n\nTechnical Master Data\n",
